Third-party material
--------------------

None at runtime. The extension ships no third-party code, libraries,
fonts, or assets; every file in extension/ is original work of this
repository (icons are generated by scripts/gen-icons.mjs).

Development dependencies (Vitest, ESLint, jsdom, and their trees) are
used for testing and linting only. They are not distributed with the
extension packages and remain subject to their own licenses, available
in the npm registry and within node_modules after installation.
